し、汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど学校の数学でドモルガンの法則を習ったのでカタカナだしなんか答えて早く抜けなきゃって焦ってて、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でオンエアみて結構はずかしめにあいました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日期末テストの結果帰ってくるよ〜......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い怖いw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもななみんがずーっと物理や数学を教えてくれたので、きっと大丈夫"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんと若月ちゃんがまあやのテストの結果を待ってるからドキドキだぁっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/16/5658067/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ歴史は楽しみかな？♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/